ography":{"zh":"号梦梅居士，隐居于终南山。曹操渭南与马超对峙之际，拜访曹操，并教曹操用浇水结冰的方法来加固土城。拒绝了曹操的褒赏后，便匆匆离去，无人知晓其去处。","tc":"號夢梅居士，隱居于終南山。曹操渭南與馬超對峙之際，拜訪曹操，并教曹操用澆水結冰的方法來加固土城。拒絕了曹操的褒賞后，便匆匆離去，無人知曉其去處。","en":"Known as the Hermit of Dream Plum, he lived in seclusion on Mount Zhongnan. During Cao Cao's confrontation with Ma Chao at Weinan, he visited Cao Cao and taught him the method of pouring water and letting it freeze to fortify earthen walls. After declining Cao Cao's generous rewards, he departed hastily, and no one knew where he went.","jp":"号は夢梅居士。終南山に隠棲していた。曹操が渭南で馬超と対峙した際、曹操を訪ね、水を撒いて凍らせることで土城を補強する方法を伝授した。曹操からの褒賞を固辞して足早に立ち去り、その行方を知る者はいなかった。","kr":"호는 몽매거사(夢梅居士)로 종남산에 은거하였다. 조조가 위남에서 마초와 대치할 때 찾아가 물을 뿌려 얼리는 방법으로 토성을 견고히 하는 계책을 일러주었다. 조조의 포상을 사양하고 홀연히 떠나간 뒤, 그 행방을 아는 이가 없었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10282","remark":"","surname":"娄","surnameTc":"婁","surnameEn":"Lou","surnameJp":"婁","surnameKr":"누","surnameOther":"","name":"圭","nameTc":"圭","nameEn":"Gui","nameJp":"圭","nameKr":"규","nameOther":"","word":"子伯","wordTc":"子伯","wordEn":"Zibo","wordJp":"子伯","wordKr":"자백","wordOther":"","icon":"娄圭","power":"WJ10058","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1001","gender":"0","rule":"52","force":"13","wise":"87","politics":"67","charm":"49","will":"67","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"13","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"4","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"3/3/3/3/3/86/20/3","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1003602;1004705","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1016705","debateSoul":"1002405","warSoulPoint":"2700","battleSoulPoint":"100","debateSoulPoint":"7500","strategy":"1003815","strategy2":"1009701","professions":"0/0/0/0/1/0/0/2/2/2/0/1/0/0/0/1/1/0/2/2/1/0/3/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50